\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 This scenario perfectly captures the thematic contrast of your world\'97the corporate exploitation of genetic material (the Elvis clones) playing in the background while Janine observes the quiet victory of her own rogue genetic modification.\
Here is the technical blueprint and narrative blocking for that final scene, written to integrate the exercise bike, the music, and the precise mechanical markers of Sarah\'92s recovery.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf0 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs40 1. The Physiological Markers on the Bike\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0 Riding an exercise bike requires extensive engagement of the pelvic girdle and the proximal lower limb muscles (specifically the gluteus maximus, quadriceps, and hamstrings). Because 
\f2\b Limb-Girdle Muscular Dystrophy (LGMD)
\f0\b0 specifically targets and destroys these muscle beds first, Sarah\'92s ability to ride a bike is the ultimate clinical confirmation for Janine.\
Janine will be watching for three specific mechanical signs that the TPlus virus has permanently integrated into Sarah's satellite cells:\
\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Eradication of the Gowers' Sign Profile:
\f0\b0  A child with LGMD lacks the pelvic floor strength to transition from sitting to standing without physically using their hands to "walk" up their own legs. Janine watches Sarah push herself up off the bike seat effortlessly using only her thighs.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Fluid Kinetic Symmetry:
\f0\b0  There is no asymmetric hitching of the hips or dropping of the pelvis to compensate for weak muscle groups. The cadence of her pedaling is smooth, circular, and consistent.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Anaerobic Threshold Shift:
\f0\b0  Thanks to the spliced 
\f2\b vent fungi and anaerobic pathways
\f0\b0  in the TPlus platform, Sarah isn't lactic-acid burning or gasping for air. Her muscles are utilizing oxygen with extreme, engineered efficiency. She is exerting real force but breathing like she is at rest.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

\f1 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs40 2. Scene Blueprint: The Final Tie\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \cb3 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f3\fs26 [ THE AUDIOSCAPE ]\
- The heavy, synthetic rockabilly rhythm of the emancipated Elvis clones fills the room. \
- The music provides a subtle world-building anchor: a reminder of what corporations \
  like Grayling and Hardy do to genetic material when they own it.\
\
[ THE MECHANICAL TRIUMPH ]\
- Sarah is on the exercise bike, her legs moving in a blur. \
- Janine stands by the door with her coat on, watching her daughter's calves and thighs. \
- The muscle definition is smooth, dense, and firm. The wasting has vanished. \
\
[ THE CONVERSATION ]\
- Sarah looks up, shouting over the music about her plans for a real bike in the park.\
- Janine steps in to check her vitals one last time under the guise of fixing her hair or \
  wiping away sweat. She touches the muscle. It is tight and resilient.\
- Janine tells her she won't need any more "vitamin shots." The treatment is over. \
  The loophole worked. Sarah is self-sustaining.\
\
[ THE SEPARATION ]\
- Janine leaves for her shift at the Pale, carrying the deep relief of a mother who \
  believes the danger is behind them. \
- Cut to the Pale: The heavy lock security bulkheads slam down on Hardy\'92s orders. \
  Janine is sealed inside the tomb, while Sarah remains at home, pedaling toward a \
  freedom she doesn't know she has just lost.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa331\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs40 3. Dialogue & Action Blocking\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f0 To help you draft the prose, consider focusing on the physical interaction between the clinical observation and the domestic setting:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\i \cf0 \strokec2 The emancipated King clones were blasting a distorted, three-chord progression through the speakers, a raw underground track recorded weeks after the Grayling Corporation lost their ownership suit.
\f0\i0 \strokec2 \

\f4\i \strokec2 Sarah was pedaling to the beat. Her knees rose and fell in perfect, fluid lines\'97no hitch in the hip, no telltale sway of a collapsing pelvic girdle. For three years, Janine had watched her daughter\'92s legs slowly turn to water. Now, the quadriceps pulled taut against the skin, dense and re-sculpted.
\f0\i0 \strokec2 \

\f4\i \strokec2 \'93Next week, Mom!\'94 Sarah yelled over the vocals, her face flushed with fresh micro-circulation but her breathing entirely steady. \'93The real one. You promised we\'92d go to the park by the river.\'94
\f0\i0 \strokec2 \

\f4\i \strokec2 Janine walked over, reaching out to catch a strand of her daughter's hair. Her fingers brushed the top of Sarah's shoulder. The deltoid muscle underneath was firm, pressing back with a spring-like resilience. It had been twenty days since the last high-concentration micro-injection. If the virus was still episomal, the histone methylation should have throttled it by Tuesday. Sarah should have been sluggish. She should have been failing.
\f0\i0 \strokec2 \

\f4\i \strokec2 Instead, the torn, hyper-dividing dystrophy cells had trapped the alien code perfectly during mitosis, stitching the panacea right into the chromosomes. Permanent integration. Self-sustaining stasis.
\f0\i0 \strokec2 \

\f4\i \strokec2 \'93No more needles, Sarah,\'94 Janine said, her voice catching beneath the music. \'93You\'92re done with the medicine. You can ride wherever you want.\'94
\f0\i0 \strokec2 \
